OL,3,GNEWSA'Police did not investigate bullet
OL,4,Ahitting my home'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA homeowner has accused the police of
OL,7,Ffailing to investigate after his house
OL,8,Fwas struck by a rifle bullet.
OL,10,FAdam McGill said a live rifle round was
OL,11,Ffired at his home in Bidford-on-Avon,
OL,12,FSouth Warwickshire, in August 2025,
OL,13,Fshattering a pane of glass in a rear
OL,14,Fwindow.
OL,16,FHe said no officer attended the scene
OL,17,Fand the case was only reopened after he
OL,18,Fcarried out his own investigation.
OL,19,F"Nobody had come to the house, nobody
OL,20,Fhad inspected the window, nobody had
OL,21,Flooked at where the round might have
OL,22,Fbeen coming from," he said.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
