OL,3,GNEWSA'Police did not investigate bullet
OL,4,Ahitting my home'
OL,5,
OL,6,FWarwickshire Police confirmed to the
OL,7,FBBC that no officer visited the
OL,8,Fproperty. The force said an
OL,9,Finvestigation into McGill's complaint
OL,10,Ffound its response was appropriate.
